=== DEMO 6 (Anh A06): Ca bien 2: Phan tu trung gia tri: them(4,4); lay 1 (Ca 5 tren phieu) ===
=================================================================
Input theo phieu: them(4); them(4); lay()
Buoc 1: them!(q, 4)
Buoc 2: them!(q, 4)
=== Sau khi them hai so 4 ===
So luong n: 2
  dau  (head) --> Node(4)
  cuoi (tail) --> Node(4)
  Chuoi lien ket: [4] -> [4] -> nothing
  Bat bien hop le: true

Buoc 3: v = lay!(q)
  -> Gia tri lay ra: 4 (Ky vong: 4)
=== Sau khi lay mot phan tu ===
So luong n: 1
  dau  (head) --> Node(4)
  cuoi (tail) --> Node(4)
  Chuoi lien ket: [4] -> nothing
  Bat bien hop le: true

-----------------------------------------------------------------
KET QUA CA BIEN 2:
  - Con lai:        [4] (Ky vong: [4])
  - So luong n:     1 (Ky vong: 1)
  - dau === cuoi:   true (Cung tro ve nut 4 duy nhat)
  - cuoi.tiep:      nothing (Ky vong: nothing)
NHAN XET:
  Moi phan tu du trung gia tri van duoc cap phat thanh mot Node doc lap;
  khi lay mot phan tu, nut con lai van duoc giu nguyen ven khong bi anh huong.

